flowchart LR
  subgraph Clinical[Clinical state]
    A[Repeated observations] --> B[Quality and provenance]
    B --> C[Age-aware safety rules]
    C --> D[Calibrated trajectory risk]
    D --> E[Conformal and OOD shell]
  end
  E --> F[Dynamic Action Window]
  F --> G[Queue Twin projected ETA]
  G --> H[Clinical Slack]
  H --> I[Deadline Board]
  I --> J{Clinician decision}
  J --> K[Hash-linked audit]
  K --> A
  C -. hard red flag .-> J
  E -. uncertainty or invalid data .-> L[Safe Mode]
  L --> J
  G -. unavailable .-> M[Feasibility unknown; clinical need preserved]

